('lemon', null, 'Ventnor Botanic Garden', 'Isle of Wight', 50.58875, -1.22817, false, 'garden', 'yes', '2026-02-04', 'One of the hardier citrus the garden has kept outside for about 15 years; reported to fruit regularly alongside six calamondins. Separate from the excluded Ichang papeda / Flying Dragon records.', 'Gardens Illustrated (Matthew Biggs, ''Growing your own lemons?'')', 'https://www.gardensillustrated.com/plants/how-to-grow-citrus', true),
