  ('orange', null, 'Ventnor Botanic Garden - outdoor citrus grove', 'Isle of Wight', 50.58875, -1.22817, false, 'garden', 'unknown', '2025-04-28', 'Planted in 2025 as part of what the garden billed as the UK''s first outdoor citrus grove; oranges among the varieties. Too new to know long-term survival.', 'Ventnor Botanic Garden media page (citing Telegraph, 28 Apr 2025)', 'https://www.botanic.co.uk/medianews/', true),
