  ('other', 'Buddha''s hand (Citrus medica ''Fingered'')', 'Ventnor Botanic Garden - outdoor citrus grove', 'Isle of Wight', 50.58875, -1.22817, false, 'garden', 'unknown', '2026-02-04', 'Buddha''s hand citron planted outdoors in the 2025 citrus grove along with mandarins, oranges and grapefruit.', 'Gardens Illustrated (Matthew Biggs, ''Growing your own lemons?'')', 'https://www.gardensillustrated.com/plants/how-to-grow-citrus', true),
  ('other', 'Calamondin', 'Osborne House walled garden, East Cowes', 'Isle of Wight', 50.75058, -1.27008, false, 'pot', 'yes', '2008-07-01', 'Fruiting calamondin in a very large pot that the observer says appears to stay outside all year; doubtful as it is containerised and overwintering was not confirmed. (Osborne lemon and bergamot excluded as already known.)', 'Home Citrus Growers', 'https://www.homecitrusgrowers.co.uk/citrusplaces/isleofwight.html', true),
  ('lemon', null, 'Lamorran House Garden, St Mawes', 'Cornwall', 50.15852, -5.01986, false, 'garden', 'yes', '2018-09-17', 'Visitor write-up says the cafe terrace is decked with lemon trees and shows ''lemons growing outside''. Doubt: not stated whether they are in the ground or in pots taken in for winter.', 'Ednovean Farm blog', 'https://ednoveanfarm.co.uk/explore-west-cornwall/visiting-local-gardens/lamorran-house-garden/', true),
